<title>CHINA: Bank Austria HK branch in HK$200 mln CD.</title>
<headline>Bank Austria HK branch in HK$200 mln CD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Austria Aktiengesellschaft's Hong Kong branch has lodged a HK$200 million fixed-rate certificates of deposit issue due March 9, 2000, with the Hong Kong Monetary Authority (HKMA) Central Moneymarkets Unit, the HKMA said.</p>
<p>The 6.5 percent certificates, were issued at par.</p>
<p>Hongkong and Shanghai Banking Corp is the arranger.</p>
<p>The payment date is July 9.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
